# Supabase — required only for online multiplayer.
# Practice Mode vs bots works fully offline without these.
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Copy Project URL + anon key from Settings → API
# 3. Run supabase/schema.sql (and seed.sql) in the SQL editor
# 4. Enable Anonymous sign-ins: Authentication → Providers → Anonymous
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
